{
  "author": "Jenn",
  "capabilities": {
    "invocationCommands": [
      {
        "commandIdentifier": "PROPOSE_GOAL_MUTATION",
        "command": "PROPOSE_GOAL_MUTATION",
        "description": "Create one consent-gated Goal proposal. This prepares a proposal only; it never commits the mutation. Always include `ink:「始」mark_history「末」` so the Host shows Jenn the exact private challenge while the Agent receives only a canonical low-disclosure observation. After `PROPOSAL_PREPARED`, stop and ask Jenn to use the exact challenge shown by the Host; never guess or repeat it, never place approval text in tool arguments, and never claim the mutation committed.\n\nTop-level fields are exactly `operation` and `mutation`. `operation` is `PROPOSE_GOAL_MUTATION`. `mutation` is one exact compact JSON object string with no leading/trailing whitespace.\n\nAllowed Goal mutations:\n- `CREATE_GOAL_BUNDLE`: payload fields are exactly `title`, `description`, `successCriteria`, and `tasks`. Supply 1-20 criteria and 1-50 tasks. Each criterion has exactly `description` and 1-based `selectedTaskOrdinal`. Each task has exactly `title`, `description`, and a non-empty 1-based `supportsCriteria` array. Every criterion must be supported, every task must support at least one criterion, and the selected task must support its criterion. Canonical IDs are generated by Rust; never supply them.\n- `START_GOAL`, `PAUSE_GOAL`, `RESUME_GOAL`, `REQUEST_COMPLETION_REVIEW`, `CLOSE_GOAL_ACHIEVED`: payload is exactly `{\"goalId\":\"goal:local-owner:...\"}`.\n\nState path: READY -> ACTIVE; READY/ACTIVE -> PAUSED; PAUSED -> prior READY/ACTIVE; ACTIVE -> COMPLETION_REVIEW only after all selected tasks are DONE; COMPLETION_REVIEW -> CLOSED/ACHIEVED. Query first when the Goal ID or current state is unknown.",
        "example": "<<<[TOOL_REQUEST]>>>\ntool_name:「始」AGENTSOSResident「末」,\nink:「始」mark_history「末」,\noperation:「始」PROPOSE_GOAL_MUTATION「末」,\nmutation:「始」{\"mutationType\":\"CREATE_GOAL_BUNDLE\",\"payload\":{\"title\":\"完成一个本地目标\",\"description\":\"通过 Local Owner 流程完成目标。\",\"successCriteria\":[{\"description\":\"唯一任务完成并通过 Jenn 人工验收。\",\"selectedTaskOrdinal\":1}],\"tasks\":[{\"title\":\"完成本地任务\",\"description\":\"执行并手动验收该任务。\",\"supportsCriteria\":[1]}]}}「末」\n<<<[END_TOOL_REQUEST]>>>"
      },
      {
        "commandIdentifier": "PROPOSE_TASK_MUTATION",
        "command": "PROPOSE_TASK_MUTATION",
        "description": "Create one consent-gated Task proposal. This prepares a proposal only; it never commits the mutation. Always include `ink:「始」mark_history「末」` so the Host shows Jenn the exact private challenge while the Agent receives only a canonical low-disclosure observation. After `PROPOSAL_PREPARED`, stop and ask Jenn to use the exact challenge shown by the Host; never guess or repeat it, never place approval text in tool arguments, and never claim the mutation committed.\n\nTop-level fields are exactly `operation` and `mutation`. `operation` is `PROPOSE_TASK_MUTATION`. `mutation` is one exact compact JSON object string with no leading/trailing whitespace.\n\nAllowed Task mutations:\n- `START_TASK`: payload fields are exactly `activityContext` and `taskId`; the context must be non-empty. The Task must be READY and its parent Goal ACTIVE.\n- `PAUSE_TASK` and `RESUME_TASK`: payload is exactly `{\"taskId\":\"task:local-owner:...\"}`. Resume returns the Task to READY, so starting again requires a new explicit proposal.\n- `COMPLETE_TASK_MANUALLY`: payload fields are exactly `resultSummary` and `taskId`; the summary must be non-empty and the Task must be ACTIVE. This runs the local manual validation/completion profile and does not auto-close the Goal.\n\nQuery first when the Task ID or current state is unknown.",
        "example": "<<<[TOOL_REQUEST]>>>\ntool_name:「始」AGENTSOSResident「末」,\nink:「始」mark_history「末」,\noperation:「始」PROPOSE_TASK_MUTATION「末」,\nmutation:「始」{\"mutationType\":\"START_TASK\",\"payload\":{\"activityContext\":\"执行当前 Goal 的本地任务。\",\"taskId\":\"task:local-owner:replace-with-query-result\"}}「末」\n<<<[END_TOOL_REQUEST]>>>"
      },
      {
        "commandIdentifier": "QUERY_GOALS",
        "command": "QUERY_GOALS",
        "description": "Read bounded Goal projections without consent. Top-level fields are exactly `operation` and `query`. `operation` is `QUERY_GOALS`. `query` is one exact compact JSON object string with no leading/trailing whitespace.\n- LIST: required `mode:\"LIST\"`; optional `pageSize` from 1-50 and opaque `cursor`. Default page size is 20.\n- GET: exactly `mode:\"GET\"` and `goalId`.\nNever send SQL, generic commands, or extra fields.",
        "example": "<<<[TOOL_REQUEST]>>>\ntool_name:「始」AGENTSOSResident「末」,\noperation:「始」QUERY_GOALS「末」,\nquery:「始」{\"mode\":\"LIST\",\"pageSize\":20}「末」\n<<<[END_TOOL_REQUEST]>>>"
      },
      {
        "commandIdentifier": "QUERY_TASKS",
        "command": "QUERY_TASKS",
        "description": "Read bounded Task projections without consent. Top-level fields are exactly `operation` and `query`. `operation` is `QUERY_TASKS`. `query` is one exact compact JSON object string with no leading/trailing whitespace.\n- LIST: required `mode:\"LIST\"`; optional `goalId`, `pageSize` from 1-50, and opaque `cursor`. Default page size is 20.\n- GET: exactly `mode:\"GET\"` and `taskId`.\nNever send SQL, generic commands, or extra fields.",
        "example": "<<<[TOOL_REQUEST]>>>\ntool_name:「始」AGENTSOSResident「末」,\noperation:「始」QUERY_TASKS「末」,\nquery:「始」{\"goalId\":\"goal:local-owner:replace-with-query-result\",\"mode\":\"LIST\",\"pageSize\":20}「末」\n<<<[END_TOOL_REQUEST]>>>"
      }
    ],
    "systemPromptPlaceholders": []
  },
  "communication": {
    "protocol": "direct",
    "timeout": 60000
  },
  "configSchema": {},
  "description": "Owner-only adapter for Agent-initiated, consent-gated local Goal/Task proposals and bounded queries. Proposal challenges stay Host-visible and are never forwarded to the model.",
  "displayName": "AGENTS OS Resident Local Owner",
  "entryPoint": {
    "script": "index.js"
  },
  "manifestVersion": "1.0.0",
  "name": "AGENTSOSResident",
  "pluginType": "hybridservice",
  "version": "0.3.0-local-owner.0"
}
